## ObjectType: Supplier

A supplier responsible for delivering inventory materials.

### Data Properties

| Name | Display Name | Type | Description | Mapped Field |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| supplier_id | Supplier ID | string | Unique supplier code | supplier_id |
| name | Name | string | Supplier name | name |
| contact_email | Contact Email | string | Alert destination | contact_email |
| expedite_supported | Expedite Supported | boolean | Whether urgent delivery is supported | expedite_supported |

